/ One transaction of the list in its own tbody, so a categorised line can replace it (categorise.turbo_stream).
/ The category cell offers "Change" (transactions/_change_categories). Under the row, each uncategorised line with
/ its suggestion and the controls to categorise it.
- message = local_assigns[:message]
tbody id=dom_id(transaction, :list)
  tr
    td.whitespace-nowrap = l(transaction.occurred_on)
    td
      = link_to transaction.payee&.name || transaction.merchant.presence || "Transaction ##{transaction.id}", transaction_path(transaction), class: "data-grid-link font-medium"
      - if transaction.comment.present?
        .text-xs.text-ink-muted = transaction.comment.truncate(80)
    td.whitespace-nowrap = transaction.account.name
    td
      = transaction_categories(transaction)
      = render "transactions/change_categories", transaction:, link_params: { filter: filter.to_params }
    td.data-grid-num = receipt_money(transaction.amount, transaction.account.currency)
    td.whitespace-nowrap = transaction_status_badge(transaction)
  - if message
    tr
      td colspan="6"
        p.text-sm.font-medium.text-ink-display role="alert" = message
  - transaction_review_lines(transaction).each do |line|
    = render "transactions/review_line", transaction:, line:, filter:
